{"code":"e3","participant":"e3 jp","condition":"grid","name":"jp task 1","id":"d452dc36-728c-44c9-889e-be345724737f","moments":{"cce58069-1b75-46a0-b862-cf04e8eea55d":{"videoName":"A001C002_240718OR","startS":7.4,"endS":10.7,"notes":"giggling"},"8509fe24-3951-419a-aa00-21c07255b510":{"videoName":"A001C002_240718OR","startS":14,"endS":25,"notes":"Hi, I'm Viviana matsuda. Um, I do pottery for a living. My brand name is Mud Witch. Um, yeah. I'm a full time potter."},"881aed5c-7eef-4e15-84c9-cae867134e3a":{"videoName":"A001C004_240718BC","startS":26.2,"endS":28.5,"notes":"So my book is called Playful Pottery."},"fa9a1ebb-21b1-47c4-b4a1-7142008d843c":{"videoName":"A001C004_240718BC","startS":30,"endS":37.6,"notes":"I wanted something that was a more simplified book about pottery for beginners."},"4493acce-cc86-41e1-8fa8-78bfe8ad9504":{"videoName":"A001C004_240718BC","startS":37.6,"endS":57.4,"notes":"I feel like what I always saw or referenced were these, like, big, hearty old school books that never really talked about color had super fun things to do in them. Um, very like old school pottery."},"59dc59f7-39a7-4f7e-92f2-c2c1cf43260b":{"videoName":"A001C004_240718BC","startS":86.9,"endS":98,"notes":"I hope the book provides to its readers at, um, like a good reference for just general, um, clay knowledge."},"847c074f-ad7f-4df9-a45c-9385586a9419":{"videoName":"A001C004_240718BC","startS":98,"endS":107.6,"notes":"But also, I really want people to be creative and be kind to themselves."},"68e164e8-293d-427a-b543-f7d66b79edca":{"videoName":"A001C004_240718BC","startS":119.8,"endS":130.5,"notes":"I think that there's a pressure to produce things. As a creative person, but not to be kind of kind to yourself about what the process is going to be like,"},"a91256f5-b86e-4366-b3ab-24fda5fc8fb1":{"videoName":"A001C004_240718BC","startS":147.4,"endS":151.6,"notes":"I think being open minded when it comes to design is really important."},"25c0b86e-d95d-4491-93a2-0ecc4e56e925":{"videoName":"A001C004_240718BC","startS":501.6,"endS":521.3,"notes":"And then you're like, well, what if this looked slightly different? Or what if this, instead of a tulip was a daffodil? And let's try to achieve that. So it's kind of like sitting at the wheel and just like letting yourself adjust, grow whatever ideas and just see if they're achievable."},"295dc021-0128-410c-9897-24eead6d1d5c":{"videoName":"A001C004_240718BC","startS":668.9,"endS":682.5,"notes":"Um, so my voice and style for mud, which it's kind of a funny thing where when I was learning to do ceramics, I was also learning about the body positivity movement."},"1cc4ef52-8e4c-4178-942c-0678f25aa8fa":{"videoName":"A001C004_240718BC","startS":693.9,"endS":702.1,"notes":"And I was like starting to make these like chubby shapes and they're literally called this is the Chubby Mug. This is the Venus mug"},"e4881014-cc83-4c0c-8752-2d6f28f9bcc5":{"videoName":"A001C004_240718BC","startS":702.3,"endS":707.8,"notes":"I think those two things kind of just mushed together the learning clay and the body positivity."},"f417ada1-9462-4854-a862-68fe326b29bc":{"videoName":"A001C004_240718BC","startS":709.9,"endS":721,"notes":"they were originally supposed to be kind of like an abstract like vision of, of people, like different bodies sitting, dancing, whatever."},"f4835fa1-4d85-4f6e-8da8-b0b4867a3476":{"videoName":"A001C004_240718BC","startS":721.7,"endS":728.5,"notes":"they used to only use raw clay, which is all skin tones, which is really interesting."},"d3522de7-521b-476e-bdee-a6ac208074b6":{"videoName":"A001C004_240718BC","startS":728.5,"endS":737.2,"notes":"so I used like 11 different types of clay, and they were all the range of skin tones. Um, so they were like naked."},"57193451-4cab-4980-bd49-0572f451463b":{"videoName":"A001C004_240718BC","startS":738.1,"endS":742.4,"notes":"and then I was like, well, let's slap some color on these, um, let's clothe these babes."},"32eae24a-a126-4198-b44e-76f7c9a8c4fe":{"videoName":"A001C004_240718BC","startS":747.2,"endS":753.7,"notes":"the style has grown into something that now is just like, fun."},"fa423965-1414-4394-bcb9-30ed756e4ad1":{"videoName":"A001C004_240718BC","startS":756,"endS":762,"notes":"I, It started off as one thing, and now it's just like, I just want to make something that, like, makes people smile."},"902e006f-bd1f-4fa4-867a-465758df35a8":{"videoName":"B003C005_240719NB","startS":0.8,"endS":13.5,"notes":"grabbing things from shelves"},"25c4d675-d3fe-4b02-a112-639cf8e10eb5":{"videoName":"B003C006_240719KM","startS":32,"endS":39,"notes":"handl paint"},"6402bfec-efed-472f-b01c-399841532086":{"videoName":"B003C006_240719KM","startS":42.6,"endS":52.4,"notes":"painting"},"a667ae09-360c-4f43-8a8b-522d9054ea2b":{"videoName":"B003C006_240719KM","startS":56.9,"endS":64.8,"notes":"zoom of paitning"},"ed55cf4d-fd64-41ab-bf93-23fcf99020aa":{"videoName":"B003C006_240719KM","startS":84.3,"endS":95,"notes":"closeup"},"607d0216-d85f-4bfa-9902-b0f51df21c85":{"videoName":"B003C006_240719KM","startS":136.4,"endS":145.1,"notes":"viviana painting"},"d4cc9df8-f590-4e02-8f37-dea91b2de766":{"videoName":"B003C006_240719KM","startS":157.5,"endS":166.6,"notes":"fast paint"},"8363d3a8-a692-4bb6-b9d3-6dd558672667":{"videoName":"B003C007_240719CC","startS":2.2,"endS":7.2,"notes":"better zoom of painting"},"b7a69ed6-1952-40a0-9963-04b3cd5e1c9d":{"videoName":"B003C007_240719CC","startS":34.2,"endS":39.8,"notes":"putting item down"},"e349c1ea-94aa-4429-895a-67c1a0fd17bd":{"videoName":"B003C007_240719CC","startS":39.7,"endS":41.8,"notes":"better zoom of painting"},"aca9219a-1cc3-41ab-ba0f-13975dccd00b":{"videoName":"B003C008_240719QA","startS":139,"endS":164,"notes":"painting glaze on a ceramic bowl"},"22f1c613-fdb9-4cfd-a9d7-3994c1312317":{"videoName":"B003C009_240719KG","startS":9,"endS":12.2,"notes":"pan of mudwitch"},"5bd86a52-5787-46c3-9053-ac87e62bdd3b":{"videoName":"B003C009_240719KG","startS":16,"endS":20.3,"notes":"mudwitch sign"},"385377d8-0a0